E201 [*] Whitespace after '('
 --> E20.py:2:6
  |
1 | #: E201:1:6
2 | spam( ham[1], {eggs: 2})
  |      ^
3 | #: E201:1:10
4 | spam(ham[ 1], {eggs: 2})
  |
help: Remove whitespace before '('
  |
2 | spam(ham[1], {eggs: 2})
  |

